  partName: Spark Plug (4)
  description: "The Spark Plug (4) is a tiny, elongated component located at the
    top-right-center of the engine, made of Material.001, which plays a crucial role
    in igniting the fuel-air mixture in the combustion chamber. Its precise positioning
    and material properties enable efficient combustion, and an interesting detail
    is that it operates at extremely high temperatures, up to 5,000\xB0F. This spark
    plug is one of multiple plugs in the engine, working in tandem to ensure smooth
    operation."
